  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Neelam Balaji vs State Rep on 24 January, 2020 Author: J. Uma Devi Bench: J. Uma Devi The Hon'Ble Ms.JUSTICE J. Uma Devi Criminal Petition No.335 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This criminal petition is filed under Section 482 r/w.457 Cr.P.C. seeking to release the vehicle i.e., Mahindra Verito Car bearing registration No.AP07-AT1654 which was involved in Cr.No186 of 2019, dated 16.12.2019, of Prathipadu Police Station, Guntur Urban, Guntur District, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 272, 273 and 328 of Indian Penal Code, under Section 24(1) of Cigarettes and Other Tobacco Products Act, 2003 and under Sections 58, 59 and 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioner states that the petitioner is the bread winner of his family, and he ekes out his likelihood by giving the seized vehicle on hire to third parties. By stating so, he request the court to order for release of the vehicle in favour of the petitioner. Learned Additional Public Prosecutor opposed the petition. The petitioner is Accused No.1 in the above mentioned crime. As per the prosecution case, petitioner/A1 and another were found carrying banned tobacco products in the subject vehicle. The investigation has not been completed so far. The petitioner is owner of the seized vehicle.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioner states that the petitioner is the bread winner of his family, and he ekes out his likelihood by giving the seized vehicle on hire to third parties.",
    "respondent_arguments": "By stating so, he request the court to order for release of the vehicle in favour of the petitioner. Learned Additional Public Prosecutor opposed the petition. The petitioner is Accused No.1 in the above mentioned crime. As per the prosecution case, petitioner/A1 and another were found carrying banned tobacco products in the subject vehicle. The investigation has not been completed so far. The petitioner is owner of the seized vehicle.",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
